    "created_at": "2025-03-26T15:11:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-26T15:11:06Z",
    "body": "> I'd suggest we split \"8.10 Images\" into two sections, one describing the ImageBitmap class and one the ImageData class.\n\nThat sounds like a very good idea. I'd want to do that in two patches: One that just does a bulk move of the `ImageData` constructors, etc, as they are, into an `ImageData` section, and the a second that re-works `ImageData`.\n\n(The reason I'm bringing this up is that I've been doing tons of archeological digs in `ImageData`, and the history continuity that that would give would be really helpful for future excavators).\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
